<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
    <title>Salty - Sign in</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/static/favicon-32.png" sizes="32x32" type="image/png">
    <link rel="icon" href="/static/icon-192.png" sizes="192x192" type="image/png">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/static/apple-touch-icon.png">

    <!--
      Hand-written CSS rather than the app's component library, and deliberately so.

      This is the one page where "unstyled" must not mean "locked out", and it is the only page a
      signed-out visitor can reach. Loading the React bundle here would put a 232 KB download and a
      framework's worth of failure modes in front of a form with two fields. So: native <input> and
      <button>, no script of any kind, and the styling below.

      The values are Fluent 2's own — the neutral ramp, brand #0f6cbd, 4px radii and the Segoe-first
      stack — copied rather than imported, so this page looks like the app it leads to without
      depending on anything to load. Light and dark both come from prefers-color-scheme.
    -->
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #f5f5f5;
        --surface: #ffffff;
        --fg: #242424;
        --fg-muted: #616161;
        --stroke: #d1d1d1;
        --stroke-accessible: #616161;
        --brand: #0f6cbd;
        --brand-hover: #115ea3;
        --brand-pressed: #0c3b5e;
        --danger-bg: #fdf3f4;
        --danger-fg: #b10e1c;
        --danger-stroke: #eeacb2;
        --radius: 4px;
        --shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, .14), 0 0 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, .12);
      }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :root {
          --bg: #1f1f1f;
          --surface: #292929;
          --fg: #ffffff;
          --fg-muted: #adadad;
          --stroke: #666666;
          --stroke-accessible: #adadad;
          --brand: #115ea3;
          --brand-hover: #0f6cbd;
          --brand-pressed: #0c3b5e;
          --danger-bg: #3b1113;
          --danger-fg: #f1707b;
          --danger-stroke: #6e2b30;
          --shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, .28), 0 0 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, .24);
        }
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100svh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        background-color: var(--bg);
        color: var(--fg);
        font-family: "Segoe UI Variable Text", "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 20px;
      }

      .signin { width: 100%; max-width: 24rem; }

      .signin__brand {
        margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
        font-size: 28px;
        line-height: 36px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .card {
        background-color: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--stroke);
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }

      .card__title { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; font-weight: 600; }

      .field { display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
      .field__label { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-weight: 600; }

      /* Fluent's input is a filled box with a heavier bottom stroke that turns brand on focus. */
      .field input {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 5px 10px;
        color: inherit;
        font: inherit;
        background-color: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--stroke);
        border-bottom-color: var(--stroke-accessible);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
      }
      .field input:hover { border-color: var(--stroke-accessible); }
      .field input:focus {
        outline: none;
        border-color: var(--stroke-accessible);
        border-bottom: 2px solid var(--brand);
        padding-bottom: 4px;
      }

      .submit {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 5px 12px;
        font: inherit;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #ffffff;
        background-color: var(--brand);
        border: 1px solid transparent;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .submit:hover { background-color: var(--brand-hover); }
      .submit:active { background-color: var(--brand-pressed); }
      .submit:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--fg); outline-offset: 2px; }

      .messagebar {
        display: flex;
        gap: .5rem;
        align-items: flex-start;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        padding: .5rem .75rem;
        color: var(--fg);
        background-color: var(--danger-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--danger-stroke);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
      }
      .messagebar svg { flex: none; color: var(--danger-fg); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<main class="signin">
    <h1 class="signin__brand"><span aria-hidden="true">&#129474;</span> Salty</h1>

    <div class="card">
        <h2 class="card__title">Sign in</h2>

        {{#error}}
        <!-- Fluent's ErrorCircleFilled, inline: one 20px glyph is not worth an icon dependency on
             the page whose whole point is having none. -->
        <div class="messagebar" role="alert">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M10 2a8 8 0 1 1 0 16 8 8 0 0 1 0-16Zm0 10.5a.75.75 0 1 0 0 1.5.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.5ZM10 6a.5.5 0 0 0-.5.41V11a.5.5 0 0 0 1 .09V6.5A.5.5 0 0 0 10 6Z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Invalid username or password.</span>
        </div>
        {{/error}}

        <form action="/login" method="post">
            <label class="field">
                <span class="field__label">Username</span>
                <input type="text" name="username" autocomplete="username"
                       autocapitalize="none" autocorrect="off" spellcheck="false" required autofocus>
            </label>
            <label class="field">
                <span class="field__label">Password</span>
                <input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required>
            </label>
            <button type="submit" class="submit">Sign in</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>
